{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_071_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "6f2f2c872cdd28e4bc343d81f8d488bc1da45093968170bb575c330fa6e4684d", "ja": "あ、そうだ。ミキ、{$P$}に\n聞きたいことがあるの。", "zh": "啊，对了。美希有件事想问问{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_071_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "3be61c46cd10ef64842a544234a5720ba6ee289067579a9787ae24d0f1432095", "ja": "{$P$}って、失恋したことある？", "zh": "{$P$}，你失恋过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
