{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_071_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "d41ebaf65169be7cc84b10facb6806fc1d3b7ce8bf1a21f5fc98293550d22c99", "ja": "{$P$}はミキのプロデューサー\nなんだから、協力してくれるよね？", "zh": "{$P$}是美希的制作人，\n所以会协助美希的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
